      "writtenOn": "2019-03-15T21:08:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The live print of seconds left was pretty useful to verify that my logic of what 1 second was worked out. I imagine someone who was implementing on another board would appreciate the same thing. Do you really think it\u0027s worth removing?",
      "parentUuid": "b00a931f_6c1b0d61",
